/E (Odors Some cultures view body odors as bad; others view them as normal. Americans work hard to neutralize body odors or cover them up and view those with body odors as dirty and unsanitary. On the other hand, in some Asian cultures people view body odors not as something to be hidden but as something that friends should experience.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
